        <main_comment_pont>
            <pont_reg_main nr="Gall. Pont. III,3 85 n. 119">Des années 1171, 1172 et 1181 qui conviennent à la présence du pape a 
                <place_name addition="1191 zerstört" category="Stadt" country="Italien" geo_DMS_city="N 41° 48′ E 12° 43′" geodata="N 41°47′55″ E 12°42′22″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" id="10376743" identification="Tusculum" institution="Civitas Tusculum" region="Latium" uuid="{FC9E8FC1-C12B-4FF2-88F9-40C5C83CC775}">Tusculum</place_name> un 24 (25) février (voir 
                <bibl_link target="Jaffé, Regesta Pontificum Romanorum" target2="54640" uuid="{77346F34-E2AC-422A-92FA-1D3BFDF42FFC}">J. L.</bibl_link>, II, p. 242, 250, 260, 407, 414), on peut écarter 1181, vu que le pape, dans sa relation detaillée, ne mentionne pas la commission du 
                <pers_name BNF="133218797" GND="11955562X" GermaniaSacra="063-01080-001" LCCN="n/83/35224" Wikidata="Q103437" addition="Giacinto Bobone; Hyacintus Bobo" floruit="ca. 1106-1198" key="193550312" life="ca. 1106-1198" place="Roma" reg="Coelestinus III papa" sex="male" termofoffice="1191-1198" uuid="{0C97D788-BCC8-4F1C-88B6-DFCFD2D98527}">cardinal-diacre Hyacinthe (Célestin III)</pers_name> de 1174 dans cette affaire; voir la charte d’ 
                <pers_name BNF="133218797" GND="11955562X" GermaniaSacra="063-01080-001" LCCN="n/83/35224" Wikidata="Q103437" addition="Giacinto Bobone; Hyacintus Bobo" floruit="ca. 1106-1198" key="193550312" life="ca. 1106-1198" place="Roma" reg="Coelestinus III papa" sex="male" termofoffice="1191-1198" uuid="{0C97D788-BCC8-4F1C-88B6-DFCFD2D98527}">Hyacinthe</pers_name> du 9 décembre 1174 (
                <bibl_link target="Chaix de Lavarene, Monumenta" target2="441331" uuid="{ADCE8DCA-A74C-4462-A086-31BF4F51F65F}">Chaix de Lavarene, Monumenta</bibl_link>, Appendice, no 63, p. 508 [erronément sous 1175]; 
                <bibl_link target="Weiß, Legaten" target2="56740" uuid="{9E3E25D3-903C-423B-AF35-2A17951F2829}">Weiß</bibl_link>, no 45, p. 188; 
                <bibl_link target="Janssen, Legaten" target2="121898" uuid="{DDDE1767-044D-4C99-9241-F26292144A95}">Janssen</bibl_link>, p. 89 n. 10). Sur le 
                <place_name category="Priorat" country="Frankreich" diocese="Arvernum" geo_DMS_city="N 45°04′21″ E 3°31′53″" geodata="N 45°04′24″ E 3°31′56″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="3026832" id="12276991" identification="Prieure de Chanteuges" institution="Prioratus de Cantagols" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{DF41302E-EDC4-4494-A22D-F1F6E35B3597}">monastère de Chanteuges</place_name>, voir 
                <bibl_link target="Gaussin, L’abbaye de La Chaise-Dieu" target2="448666" uuid="{D4031437-7222-4C1A-8E3F-D26A71B7A5BF}">Gaussin, L’abbaye de La Chaise-Dieu, 1962</bibl_link>, p. 150–151, 229–231, qui ne connaît (p. 182) que la commisssion du 
                <pers_name BNF="133218797" GND="11955562X" GermaniaSacra="063-01080-001" LCCN="n/83/35224" Wikidata="Q103437" addition="Giacinto Bobone; Hyacintus Bobo" floruit="ca. 1106-1198" key="193550312" life="ca. 1106-1198" place="Roma" reg="Coelestinus III papa" sex="male" termofoffice="1191-1198" uuid="{0C97D788-BCC8-4F1C-88B6-DFCFD2D98527}">cardinal-diacre Hyacinthe</pers_name>. On notera ici une éventuelle commission de 
                <pers_name floruit="1163-1173" literature="Chevalier, Notes, S. 269" place="Die" reg="Petrus III episcopus" sex="male" termofoffice="1163 belegt - 1173 belegt" uuid="{65639536-7D2C-41D5-A462-860DFE526A22}">l’évêque Pierre</pers_name> dans un conflit opposant 
                <place_name GND_city="4119350-7" LCCN_city="n81101041" VIAF_city="11146030574635861686" addition="bis 1158 in Avignon, dann in Valence beheimatet; seit dem 14. Jh. intra muros" category="Kanonikerstift" country="Frankreich" diocese="Avennio/Valentia" geo_DEZIMAL_city="44.9325°, 4.891111°" geo_DMS_city="N 44° 55′ 57″ E 4° 53′ 28″" geodata="N 44°56′02″ E 4°53′22″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="2971053" id="122266954" identification="Saint-Ruf" institution="Ecclesia S. Ruffi" literature="Gall. Pont. III,3, S. 328-413" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{8C73A63A-A194-46BC-ADBB-1222EA1EDD9B}">Saint-Ruf</place_name> a l’évêque de 
                <place_name category="Bistum" country="Frankreich" diocese="Vivarium" geo_DEZIMAL_city="44.4828, 4.68895" geo_DMS_city="N 44°28′58″ E 4°41′20″" geodata="N 44°28′55″ E 4°41′25″" geodata_region="-1" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="2967820" id="12047232" identification="Viviers, episc." institution="Episcopatus Vivariensis" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{02075C7B-A0E6-44CE-B120-62F8DE2FC7BA}">Viviers</place_name>, prévue par 
