                <place_name category="Priorat" country="Frankreich" diocese="Arvernum" geo_DMS_city="N 45°04′21″ E 3°31′53″" geodata="N 45°04′24″ E 3°31′56″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="3026832" id="12276991" identification="Prieure de Chanteuges" institution="Prioratus de Cantagols" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{DF41302E-EDC4-4494-A22D-F1F6E35B3597}">Cantagols (Chanteuges, diocèse du Puy)</place_name> exortam, qualiter illud monasterium olim a 
